## Why This Is Asked
Assess mastery of CSS Grid, density toggle, and accessibility for production dashboards.

## Key Concepts
- Grid: fixed columns with responsive adjustments
- Density: using data-layout to alter gaps and typography
- Animations: entrance/hover/focus, respect reduced-motion
- Accessibility: keyboard focus, visible focus rings

## Code Example
```css
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
.grid[data-layout="dense"] { gap: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
@media (max-width: 1200px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
```
